{{Passive skill box|Radiant Crusade}}
'''Radiant Crusade''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Guardian]] that grants you the skill [[Summon Sentinel of Radiance]]. A portion of [[receiving damage|damage taken]] is taken by your Sentinel of Radiance. 

This damage redirection is multiplicative (occuring in separate steps) with other similar stats, and the Sentinel of Radiance always takes damage first before other targets.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/991073626721763429/991092346651287623/1197890679205015562</ref>

